ACT XIV OF 2014
ACT XIV OF 2014
BALOCHISTAN WILDLIFE (PROTECTION, PRESERVATION, CONSERVATION AND
MANAGEMENT) ACT, 2014
An Act to provide protection, preservation, conservation, sustainable and
management to the Wildlife, and establishment and management of protection
areas in the Province of Balochistan.
[Gazette of Balochistan, Extraordinary, 28th March, 2014]
